(QGCoder demo - simple engraving)
(Units: millimetres, absolute positioning)

G21 G90 G17 G40 G94

S1000 M3            (spindle on, clockwise)
F200

G0 Z10.000
G0 X-10.000 Y-5.000
G1 Z-0.500 F100
G1 X10.000 Y-5.000 F300      (engrave a line)
G1 X10.000 Y5.000
G1 X-10.000 Y5.000
G1 X-10.000 Y-5.000
G0 Z10.000
G0 X0.000 Y0.000

M5                (spindle off)
M2                (end of program)
